# Contract-freeze zone (T1-4, G3): the golden fixtures and their CHECKSUMS.sha256
# manifest are a byte-identical copy of the ETL repo's tests/golden/ tree. Pin the
# whole tree to LF regardless of core.autocrlf, so the checked-out bytes - and
# therefore the sha256 digests the jest `checksums` test recomputes - never drift
# from the sealed manifest. Keep this rule in sync with the ETL repo's .gitattributes.
tests/golden/** text eol=lf
